laurel 2004: SweetCPU soft-fail: a secondary core the firmware refuses (PSCI CPU_ON != 0, -4 = ALREADY_ON) or that is not alive after 5 s is marked off-line (LAUREL CPU: off: ...) and the boot goes on with the cores that came up. The boot core still panics. Helper sweet_cpu_mark_offline (osfmk/arm64/cpu.c) puts the processor back to PROCESSOR_OFF_LINE.
diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetCPU.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetCPU.cpp
